@startuml Activity Diagram - View Document List

skinparam dpi 150
skinparam activityPadding 6
skinparam activityMargin 6
skinparam arrowThickness 1
skinparam notePadding 4
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

|User|
start

|System|
:(1) Open Knowledge / Documents view;
:(2) Display document list (paged);

|User|
:(3) Search / Filter (optional);
:(4) Select document to view/download;

|System|
:(5) If documents found show results else show empty state; 
stop

@enduml